            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'> N8 Applications (462 firms) dominates. Upstream N1–N3 is thin. Midstream N4, N5, N7 bridges manufacturing and delivery.</run>
