            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>R - Resilience:</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'> N6 Operations (1 region) is most fragile. N8 and N9 (13 regions each) are most resilient</run>
